{"1450270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Kill Fish", "steam_appid": 1450270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Surreal Side-Scrolling Platformer Adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kill Fish</strong> is a 2D side-scroll platformer set in a mysterious and oppressive world filled with secrets, hand-drawn art, and a mystical story. Players guide a worn and haunted protagonist as he navigates strange environments, confronting physical challenges and metaphorical reflections on past mistakes. Steam Store</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Action and Puzzle Integration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay blends <strong>platforming, action, and puzzle elements</strong>, creating experiences that require dexterity, timing, and thoughtful observation. Levels present environmental obstacles, enemy encounters, and recurring motifs that reinforce the game’s surreal tone. Steam Discovery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game strikes a balance between challenge and satisfaction, with a difficulty that is high but generally fair. Steam Store</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive Story and Visual Style</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill Fish is distinguished by its <strong>hand-drawn graphics</strong> and atmospheric presentation, pulling players into a world that feels eerie, dreamlike, and reflective. The <strong>multi-layered narrative</strong> explores themes of regret, repetition, and self-discovery as the protagonist attempts to escape his past but finds himself caught in repeating cycles. Steam Store</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is designed for players who enjoy <i>thoughtful platform adventures</i> with a strong artistic and narrative presence. Steam Store</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surreal 2D side-scroll platformer gameplay Steam Store</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blend of action,